 "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_683890534781612_1845730143550472367_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vZIV5QZnQ3IQ7kNvwFB49dU&_nc_oc=AdoufSJ0jBcTkneq2q2i8YjWWHh7p04m5lXLpuhhRPvQlhKyolVCmm-YyEWTLUSsA7Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0214TGaVte4QAO1xmcYVS3FFhnkMv-YjA38yETYKWQTg&oe=69D90CA4"}, {"file_name": "3 SC- upgrade.png", "id": "1089105139847913", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302770_1089105146514579_4248858233085192791_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M1MO3r9pe-sQ7kNvwEsr1db&_nc_oc=AdqvZMuwE8TEkipi9BVpLB5r5rpo31Qr8oiKagNj50So2rKaojCfbyNrWgBgnSnS4HA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2gFrZvJHTzM2ClztEDMz2ElHY8T-1d7knHemtI2wQk1Q&oe=69D8F02C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_03_Combat.png", "id": "910125081636304", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307326_910125084969637_8062525329240909942_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gNs7bsiHbjAQ7kNvwFTT_4h&_nc_oc=Adp6M3gMqmZuVBoUaxTmGA77BsMehb3yzEf13ngrdGEkGmrCYxHV6C-42GCcbYk0D8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1x6CnUEsdYcvwSkI28_NsNxSCWnrd9MQ9ds76aBiMchQ&oe=69D8EF1C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_02_Combat.png", "id": "782108887855752", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_782108891189085_1310893654474811832_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dZbC-CnW6XMQ7kNvwEpgw4w&_nc_oc=Adr4ndZaVWnyZL4QDlkbQCJimYPemiYQUDSkrttjW7vqJWKR_ATn0i3PpoK_emfvCXU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0lr6sPG6OHhBUXSFxwbTsyYbjCUBo7PODAgR9W-wIo0A&oe=69D8E29D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Thumbnail.png", "id": "2692830891061149", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_2692830894394482_8747474291273843826_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zC69sMqIhngQ7kNvwH6DJZ4&_nc_oc=AdpTDP8qgpZoh0mrPL46SgOOQrJrrKxP5pYTkoHZIvaeFDB63X4Nq8-mZW3D-myyvQI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1-RPl6vwSZMZW9rzJHwv6ZB7HmWKFJjPA390d91Hw0iQ&oe=69D8E7CF"}, "display_name": "Plasmaborne", "keywords": ["Shooter", "roguelike", "Hell", "Demons"], "long_description": "# Fast. Fluid. Ferocious\nDescend into the abyss and tear through handcrafted arenas where speed, precision, and raw power rule. Plasmaborne is a high-intensity single-player VR roguelike shooter built for players who crave momentum, mastery, and chaos.\n{2188548808336788}\n# Become Godlike!\nFall. Rise. Adapt. Collect upgrades, forge new builds, and return stronger than before. Each failure feeds progress, sharpening your instincts and unlocking new ways to fight.\n{747652215014871}\n# Dual-Wield Destruction\nBuild your own loadout, each hand with a powerful weapon and layer on passives that reshape your playstyle. Build your kit in the lobby, then unleash it in the arena. Every run becomes a different kind of chaos.\n{1178417621063675}\nFusing tight gunplay, brutal melee, and searing flamethrower chaos into one relentless VR combat experience.\n{1591134325586122}\n# Handcrafted Arenas. Infinite Replay\nEach battleground pushes fresh tactics and reactions. Learn enemy behaviors, chain stylish dashes, and ride perfect momentum through escalating challenges.\n\n", "short_description": "Plasmaborne is a fast, high-intensity VR roguelike shooter built for players who thrive on speed and precision. Tear through handcrafted arenas with dual-wielded weapons and powerful passives like swords, flamethrowers, and character augments. Build your loadout in the lobby, teleport-dash through escalating enemies, and unlock upgrades that transform every run. Built for full-motion VR, Plasmaborne delivers heavy recoil, crisp gunfeel, and endlessly replayable combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cybersnake-x.com/privacy-policy.html", "dev